@startuml
title WarpTalk - User In-App Notification Inbox & Preference Management

autonumber

<style>
sequenceDiagram {
  participant {
    Margin 10
  }
  box {
    Margin 10
  }
}
</style>

skinparam maxMessageSize 160

actor "Authenticated User" as User
boundary "NotificationBell / Inbox UI" as Web
control "API Gateway" as Gateway

box "Notification Service" #LightSalmon
participant ":NotificationsController" as Controller <<boundary>>
participant ":NotificationService" as Service <<service>>
participant ":NotificationInboxMessageRepository" as InboxRepo <<control>>
participant ":NotificationPreferenceRepository" as PrefRepo <<control>>
database "Notification Database" as Db
end box

== FLOW 1: FETCH USER IN-APP NOTIFICATION INBOX ==

User -> Web : Click Notification Bell / Open Inbox
activate Web

Web -> Gateway : GET /api/v1/notifications?page=1&pageSize=20\n[with JWT Token]
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Controller : GetUserNotifications(query, cancellationToken)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : GetUserNotificationsAsync(userId, query, ct)
activate Service

Service -> InboxRepo : GetUserInboxMessagesAsync(userId, query)
activate InboxRepo
InboxRepo -> Db : SELECT FROM notification_inbox_messages\nWHERE user_id = userId ORDER BY created_at DESC
activate Db
Db --> InboxRepo : Inbox records & total unread count
deactivate Db
InboxRepo --> Service : PagedList<NotificationInboxMessage>
deactivate InboxRepo

Service --> Controller : Result.Success(PagedResponse<NotificationInboxDto>)
deactivate Service
Controller --> Gateway : 200 OK (Notifications & UnreadCount)
deactivate Controller
Gateway --> Web : 200 OK
deactivate Gateway

Web --> User : Render Notification List & Unread Badge Count
deactivate Web

== FLOW 2: MARK NOTIFICATION AS READ ==

User -> Web : Click on an unread notification item
activate Web

Web -> Gateway : PATCH /api/v1/notifications/{id}/read\n[with JWT Token]
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Controller : MarkAsRead(id, cancellationToken)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : MarkAsReadAsync(userId, notificationId, ct)
activate Service

Service -> InboxRepo : GetByIdAsync(notificationId)
activate InboxRepo
InboxRepo -> Db : SELECT FROM notification_inbox_messages WHERE id = notificationId
activate Db
Db --> InboxRepo : Message entity
deactivate Db
InboxRepo --> Service : Message entity
deactivate InboxRepo

alt Message Not Found or Ownership Mismatch
  Service --> Controller : Result.Failure(NotFound)
  Controller --> Gateway : 404 Not Found
  Gateway --> Web : Display error
else Message Belongs to User
  Service -> InboxRepo : Update(message with IsRead = true, ReadAt = UtcNow)
  activate InboxRepo
  InboxRepo --> Service : Tracked
  deactivate InboxRepo

  Service -> InboxRepo : SaveChangesAsync()
  activate InboxRepo
  InboxRepo -> Db : UPDATE notification_inbox_messages SET is_read = true
  activate Db
  Db --> InboxRepo : Saved
  deactivate Db
  InboxRepo --> Service : Saved
  deactivate InboxRepo

  Service --> Controller : Result.Success()
  deactivate Service
  Controller --> Gateway : 200 OK (or 204 No Content)
  deactivate Controller
  Gateway --> Web : 200 OK
  deactivate Gateway

  Web --> User : Update UI badge & dim read notification
  deactivate Web
end

== FLOW 3: UPDATE NOTIFICATION CHANNEL PREFERENCES ==

User -> Web : Change Notification Settings (e.g. disable Email for meeting reminders)
activate Web

Web -> Gateway : PUT /api/v1/notifications/preferences\n[UpdateNotificationPreferencesRequest + JWT]
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Controller : UpdatePreferences(request, cancellationToken)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : UpdatePreferencesAsync(userId, request, ct)
activate Service

Service -> PrefRepo : AddOrUpdatePreferencesAsync(userId, preferences)
activate PrefRepo
PrefRepo -> Db : INSERT / UPDATE notification_preferences WHERE user_id = userId
activate Db
Db --> PrefRepo : Saved
deactivate Db
PrefRepo --> Service : Saved
deactivate PrefRepo

Service --> Controller : Result.Success(NotificationPreferencesDto)
deactivate Service
Controller --> Gateway : 200 OK (NotificationPreferencesDto)
deactivate Controller
Gateway --> Web : 200 OK
deactivate Gateway

Web --> User : Display success toast & updated preference toggles
deactivate Web

@enduml
